OL,3,GNEWSAStatue commemorates miners who
OL,4,Adied in explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statue honouring ten miners who died
OL,7,Fin an underground explosion 140 years
OL,8,Fago has been unveiled.
OL,10,FOn 10 September 1886, a huge blast at
OL,11,FDean Lane Pit in Bedminster, Bristol,
OL,12,Fkilled the workers, including a
OL,13,F15-year-old, and injured many more.
OL,15,FGary Atterton, from Bedminster
OL,16,FCoalminers Heritage Group, said he
OL,17,Fhoped the 7ft (2.1m) metal minor, at
OL,18,FDame Emily Park in Bedminster, would
OL,19,Fremind people of a "forgotten part of
OL,20,FBristol's history".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
